@host = http://localhost:5167

### Get all books with pagination
GET {{host}}/books
Accept: application/json
X-Page: 1
X-Page-Size: 10


### Add new book
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Les Misérables",
    "author": "Victor Hugo",
    "isbnNumber": "2010008995"
}